        "answer_image": null,
        "explanation": "<p>Use the formula for the volume of a cone: $V = \\frac{1}{3} \\pi r^2 h$.<br>Substitute $r = 3$ cm and $h = 4$ cm: $V = \\frac{1}{3} \\times \\frac{22}{7} \\times 3^2 \\times 4$.<br>$V = \\frac{1}{3} \\times \\frac{22}{7} \\times 9 \\times 4 = \\frac{22 \\times 36}{21} = \\frac{792}{21} = 37.71$ cm\u00b3 (approx).</p>",
